      "role": "official-current-affiliation-and-2026-hiura-statistics",
      "note": "히우라현키움소속,2026 72G .272 13HR 43RBI OPS.811 및10월경기5개19AB7H(.368)확인.재계약검토를이선수페이지가공식발표했다고주장하지않는다."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.koreabaseball.com/Record/Player/HitterDetail/Basic.aspx?playerId=54944",
      "publishedAt": null,
      "role": "official-current-affiliation-and-2026-davidson-background",
      "note": "데이비슨현키움소속확인.2026 124G .297 28HR89RBI는NC+키움합산이므로키움단독기록으로쓰지않는다.본문은별도KBO보도자료의9~10월기록사용."
    },
    {
